// (dyn AND 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF) << 136
// the AND mask gives the value a provable U64 range (LiveLimbs=1), so the SHL
// const path (CompShift=2, ShiftMod=8) drives result limb 3 down the
// carry-only branch: SrcIdx=1 is a dead shifted term but its carry term reads
// the live limb Value[0] (Value[0] >> 56), so limb 3 is one shift, no OR.
PUSH32 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x00
MLOAD
PUSH8 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
AND
PUSH1 0x88
SHL
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x20
PUSH1 0x00
RETURN
